Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Colin Noon represent or represent?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 84, "text": "**SHOCK TRANSFER ROCKS RUGBY WORLD: COLIN NOON MAKES SURPRISE MOVE TO HAMBURGER SV**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 86, "end": 256, "text": "In a stunning turn of events, English rugby union star Colin Noon has abandoned the pitch for the pitch, signing a multi-year deal with German football club Hamburger SV."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 257, "end": 365, "text": "The news sent shockwaves through the rugby community, leaving fans and pundits alike scratching their heads."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 366, "end": 609, "text": "According to sources close to the deal, Noon, 32, was approached by Hamburger SV's management last month, and after a series of secret meetings, the former England international agreed to trade in his rugby boots for a pair of football cleats."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 610, "end": 799, "text": "\"I've always had a passion for football, and the opportunity to play for a storied club like Hamburger SV was too good to pass up,\" Noon said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 800, "end": 900, "text": "\"I'm excited to bring my physicality and competitive spirit to the pitch and help the team succeed.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 901, "end": 1041, "text": "Noon, who earned 38 caps for England between 2004 and 2009, has been out of the rugby spotlight since his retirement from the sport in 2012."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1042, "end": 1161, "text": "However, it appears he's been keeping busy, secretly training with a local football club in his hometown of Birmingham."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1162, "end": 1257, "text": "\"Hamburger SV is getting a top-notch athlete,\" said Noon's former England teammate, Mark Cueto."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1258, "end": 1367, "text": "\"Colin's always been an exceptional player, and I have no doubt he'll make a seamless transition to football."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1368, "end": 1435, "text": "He's got the size, strength, and agility to dominate on the pitch.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1436, "end": 1585, "text": "Hamburger SV, currently sitting 12th in the Bundesliga table, is hoping Noon's arrival will provide a much-needed boost to their struggling campaign."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1586, "end": 1728, "text": "The club's sporting director, Jens Todt, expressed his excitement about the signing, saying, \"Colin brings a unique set of skills to our team."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1729, "end": 1873, "text": "His rugby background will undoubtedly add a new dimension to our game, and we're confident he'll become a fan favorite at the Volksparkstadion.\""}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1874, "end": 1986, "text": "Noon is expected to make his debut for Hamburger SV in their upcoming match against FC Union Berlin on March 17."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1987, "end": 2183, "text": "When asked about the challenges of adapting to a new sport, Noon remained confident, citing his experience playing rugby sevens, a variant of the sport that shares some similarities with football."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2184, "end": 2320, "text": "\"I'm not naive to the fact that there will be a learning curve, but I'm a quick learner, and I'm willing to put in the work,\" Noon said."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 81, "text": "**Breaking News: Colin Noon's Rugby Career Takes Flight with Biarritz Olympique**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 83, "end": 276, "text": "In a move that has sent shockwaves through the rugby community, English rugby union player Colin Noon has officially joined the ranks of French professional rugby union team Biarritz Olympique."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 277, "end": 460, "text": "This development has left fans and pundits alike buzzing with excitement, as Noon's impressive skills on the pitch are expected to bolster the team's chances in upcoming competitions."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 461, "end": 608, "text": "According to sources close to the team, Noon's transfer was finalized earlier this week, with the player putting pen to paper on a multi-year deal."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 609, "end": 700, "text": "When asked about the move, Noon expressed his enthusiasm for the new chapter in his career."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 701, "end": 814, "text": "\"I'm thrilled to be joining Biarritz Olympique and can't wait to get started,\" he said in an exclusive interview."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 815, "end": 927, "text": "\"The team's rich history and commitment to excellence align perfectly with my own goals and values as a player.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 928, "end": 1087, "text": "Noon's impressive resume, which includes stints with English clubs such as Sale Sharks and Worcester Warriors, made him a hot commodity on the transfer market."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1088, "end": 1269, "text": "Biarritz Olympique's coach, Jack Isaac, praised Noon's versatility and skillset, saying, \"Colin brings a level of experience and physicality that will undoubtedly enhance our squad."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1270, "end": 1344, "text": "We're confident he'll be a valuable asset in our pursuit of Top 14 glory.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1345, "end": 1543, "text": "Data from the French Rugby Federation reveals that Biarritz Olympique has been actively seeking to strengthen its squad in recent months, with Noon's signing marking a significant coup for the team."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1544, "end": 1651, "text": "The club's president, Louis-Vincent Gave, emphasized the importance of attracting top talent to the region."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1652, "end": 1797, "text": "\"We're committed to building a competitive team that our fans can be proud of, and Colin's arrival is a major step in that direction,\" he stated."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1798, "end": 1950, "text": "Rugby analysts have been quick to praise the move, citing Noon's ability to adapt to different playing styles and his impressive work rate on the pitch."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1951, "end": 2121, "text": "\"Colin Noon is a quality player who will undoubtedly bring a new level of intensity to Biarritz Olympique's forward pack,\" said renowned rugby commentator, Stuart Barnes."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2122, "end": 2256, "text": "\"This signing is a major statement of intent from the club, and I expect them to make a strong push for the Top 14 title this season.\""}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2257, "end": 2371, "text": "As Noon prepares to don the Biarritz Olympique jersey for the first time, fans are eagerly anticipating his debut."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Colin Noon", "scope": "sports team representation", "claim": "Colin Noon signed a multi-year deal with German football club Hamburger SV.", "answer": "Hamburger SV", "quote": "In a stunning turn of events, English rugby union star Colin Noon has abandoned the pitch for the pitch, signing a multi-year deal with German football club Hamburger SV. The news sent shockwaves through the rugby community, leaving fans and pundits alike scratching their heads. According to sources close to the deal, Noon, 32, was approached by Hamburger SV's management last month, and after a series of secret meetings, the former England international agreed to trade in his rugby boots for a pair of football cleats.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Colin Noon", "scope": "current team", "claim": "English rugby union player Colin Noon has officially joined the ranks of French professional rugby union team Biarritz Olympique.", "answer": "Biarritz Olympique", "quote": "In a move that has sent shockwaves through the rugby community, English rugby union player Colin Noon has officially joined the ranks of French professional rugby union team Biarritz Olympique.", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c1", "entity": "Colin Noon", "scope": "past team", "claim": "Noon's impressive resume includes stints with English clubs such as Sale Sharks.", "answer": "Sale Sharks", "quote": "Noon's impressive resume, which includes stints with English clubs such as Sale Sharks and Worcester Warriors, made him a hot commodity on the transfer market.", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c2", "entity": "Colin Noon", "scope": "past team", "claim": "Noon's impressive resume includes stints with English clubs such as Worcester Warriors.", "answer": "Worcester Warriors", "quote": "Noon's impressive resume, which includes stints with English clubs such as Sale Sharks and Worcester Warriors, made him a hot commodity on the transfer market.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Hamburger SV", "Biarritz Olympique", "Sale Sharks", "Worcester Warriors"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Hamburger SV", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Biarritz Olympique", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "Sale Sharks", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R3", "answer": "Worcester Warriors", "origin": "initial"}]}

